{"title":"Giants Knucklebone","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Hill Giant Titan, Hill Giant Behemoth, Hill Giant Youth</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>An <b>enchant reagent</b>. Each <b>infuse</b> (one carat more) of one of these uses one:</p><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>of the Titan</b> <span class=\"muted\">(gems: Iolite + Topaz + any gem)</span></li><li><b>of the Artisan</b></li><li><b>of Quick Growth</b></li><li><b>Topaz rings and pendants</b> <span class=\"muted\">(their gem: <a href=\"#/item/gem-topaz\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/03ef45d199ff9cf40c25.svg\" alt=\"\">Gem Topaz</a>)</span></li></ul><p><b>Dropped by</b> <b>Hill Giant</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-youth\">Hill Giant Youth</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-adolescent\">Hill Giant Adolescent</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-titan\">Hill Giant Titan</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/frost-giant\">Frost Giant</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/frost-giant-brute\">Frost Giant Brute</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth\">Hill Giant Behemoth</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/frost-giant-chieftain\">Frost Giant Chieftain</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-brute\">Hill Giant Brute</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-king\">Hill Giant King</a><br><b>Ogre</b>: <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth\">Ogre Youth</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\">Gaunt Ogre</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre\">Ogre</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler\">Ogre Mauler</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher\">Ogre Butcher</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger\">Ogre Charger</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman\">Ogre Shaman</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder\">Ogre Elder</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain\">Mountain Ogre</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-carver\">Ogre Carver</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-firespeaker\">Ogre Firespeaker</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-unmoved\">The Unmoved</a>, <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-warchief\">Ogre Warchief</a>, about 1 kill in 500 (an elite 1 in 50).</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a> for the odds and fees, and <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a> for every reagent.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-behemoth\" title=\"Hill Giant Behemoth - dropped it in 1 of 16 looted corpses (1/16)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9c1502dd610dfce57688.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Behemoth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/16<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-youth\" title=\"Hill Giant Youth - dropped it in 1 of 23 looted corpses (1/23)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/969fc0f03105396b9256.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Youth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/23<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"hill-giant-titan\" title=\"Hill Giant Titan - dropped it in 1 of 27 looted corpses (1/27)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d99cb5199dc9fe13caf8.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Hill Giant Titan</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/27<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"giants-knucklebone\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/4d86da0826d500792847.svg\" alt=\"Giants Knucklebone\"></div><h3>Giants Knucklebone</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>3 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/28/2026, 11:13:51 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}